{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"duration_ms":99933,"duration_api_ms":154719,"num_turns":11,"result":"","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"571db5c5-415f-48f8-91b3-978273d4cda3","total_cost_usd":0.6199441,"usage":{"input_tokens":5,"cache_creation_input_tokens":50267,"cache_read_input_tokens":179588,"output_tokens":3050,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":50267,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":81,"outputTokens":8443,"cacheReadInputTokens":245091,"cacheCreationInputTokens":58321,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.13970635,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":5,"outputTokens":3050,"cacheReadInputTokens":179588,"cacheCreationInputTokens":50267,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.48023775,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"structured_output":{"evidence":["All 7 priority parameter families have provenance metadata: process/default.toml carries 36 param_meta entries covering AOB/NOB/comammox K_s values (6 entries), all nitrifier and decomposer vmax/growth_yield/decay_rate controls (12 entries), denitrification parameters (5 entries), stoichiometric constants (2 entries), and plant/algae growth rate maxima (4 entries). neocaridina_davidi.toml carries 18 param_meta entries covering shrimp reproduction temperature curves, molt mineral thresholds, chloride-nitrite protection, TAN/NO2 suppression endpoints, and condition/molt-stress/NH3 tunables.","Confidence tiers are explicit and machine-readable throughout: process param_meta entries span literature (18), expert (8), and heuristic (10) tiers; shrimp param_meta entries span literature (2), expert (6), heuristic (9), and placeholder (1). PROVENANCE_STATUS.md opens with a four-tier definition table (literature/expert/heuristic/placeholder) with clear action-needed columns.","Legacy param_meta migration bug (fr-3-92da51e1 from prior final review) is fixed: migrate_legacy_process_param_meta_key() now calls normalize_legacy_process_param_meta() which rewrites the unit field to the canonical unit and scales valid_range bounds through the same transform function used for the numeric value. Verified by regression test test_process_preset_parser_migrates_legacy_nitrogen_param_meta_range_units.","ATMOSPHERIC_CO2_PPM (fr-3-7fd25e44 from prior final review) now carries a doc comment citing 'rounded NOAA background-atmosphere anchor from the late-2010s / ~2020 global mean envelope', confidence expert, and explicitly noting it is held fixed for the current model scope.","Missing biomass-rate provenance (fr-3-f497e356 from prior final review) is resolved: all 12 decomposer/AOB/NOB/comammox vmax, growth_yield, and decay_rate parameters now have param_meta with explicit confidence (heuristic for vmax, expert for yield/decay) and derivation notes. Locked by regression test shipped_process_biomass_rate_controls_have_provenance_metadata.","Developer-facing summary docs/PROVENANCE_STATUS.md (175 lines) distinguishes strong anchors from provisional approximations with dedicated sections for Nitrogen Kinetics (strong anchors + biomass-rate controls), Denitrification, Carbonate Chemistry (code-resident constants + source-water presets), Habitat/Biofilter Scaling, and Shrimp Biology. Includes 'How to Use This Summary' section and lists parameters not yet annotated.","Enriched TOML files load through standard serde deserialization with no special-case hacks. param_meta is optional via serde defaults. All tests pass: tank_data 41 tests, tank_core 500+ tests across unit and integration suites, tank_scenarios all green. Clippy clean across all three packages with zero warnings.","Denitrification fields propagate end-to-end through ProcessParamsPreset → scenario materialization → runtime ProcessParams, verified by test process_preset_mapping_carries_denitrification_fields. Prior self-referencing TODO replaced with 5 formal param_meta entries.","Representative enriched files exist for each parameter family: default.toml (process/nitrogen kinetics/denitrification), neocaridina_davidi.toml (shrimp), hard_shrimp.toml and moderate.toml (source-water), active_planted.toml and coarse_porous.toml (substrate)."],"findings_or_gaps":["soft_acidic.toml and ro_like.toml source-water profiles lack per-parameter param_meta. Documented in PROVENANCE_STATUS.md as lower priority; representative coverage is met via hard_shrimp.toml and moderate.toml.","inert_sand.toml and inert_gravel.toml substrate files lack colonizable_area_factor param_meta. Representative coverage is met via active_planted.toml and coarse_porous.toml.","Carbonate solver constants (pKa1, pKa2, K_H) use doc-comment provenance rather than TOML param_meta since they are code-resident constants not TOML-loaded presets. This is an intentional design choice documented in PROVENANCE_STATUS.md and the chemistry.rs header comment.","Process routing fractions (assimilation, respiration, excretion splits) and thermal transport constants remain listed as pending future annotation in PROVENANCE_STATUS.md.","The alkalinity budget unit-safety concern (meq stored in mg-named fields in a separate worktree) remains unresolved but is correctly out-of-scope for this provenance-focused bead."],"follow_up_or_amendments":[],"outcome":"approved"},"fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"5e27f9f2-7d14-4c2b-a1f2-14f24ecd0b77"}
